CowSwapModuleFactory_Ownership
├── when initial owner is zero address
│   └── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner
├── when initial owner is valid
│   ├── it should set the owner
│   └── it should not make the deployer the owner
├── when renounceOwnership is called
│   └── it should revert with CowSwapModuleFactory_OwnershipCannotBeRenounced
└── when ownership is transferred
    ├── it should not change the owner until accepted
    ├── it should set and then clear the pending owner
    ├── it should let the new owner create modules
    └── it should still reject a non-owner caller
